        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="meta-label">Role & Purpose:</td>
          <td>This file contains the complete SQL DDL statements to create all 5 required database tables (`Admin`, `Patient`, `Doctor`, `Appointment`, `Notification`) along with primary keys, foreign key constraints, indexes, and character sets. Used by database administrators or automatic migration engines to initialize the MySQL database.</td>
        </tr>
